      "writtenOn": "2022-05-03T04:31:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The latest patch set is significantly different:\n\n- We don\u0027t ever force the AC off. If a charger is connected and then disconnected, we still boot to the chargesplash display and indicate that it\u0027s not charging.\n- That requires modification of how tries are counted as we don\u0027t consider it to be a \"cancel\" condition anymore. Instead, we keep a log of how many requests we made in the last 15 minutes. If it exceeds a pre-defined threshold (5 requests), then we lockout the feature until AC is stable (either connected or disconnected) for 15 minutes. A power button press also resets the lockout.",
      "parentUuid": "0a20b735_a4f1cdda",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 99,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 99,
        "endChar": 25
